      },
      "text": "```\n                        EXPOSURE\n                       /    |    \\\n                      /     |     \\\n             APERTURE    SHUTTER   ISO / FILM SPEED\n             (f-stop)    SPEED     (sensor sensitivity)\n                │           │             │\n                ▼           ▼             ▼\n            Controls     Controls      Controls\n            light        motion blur   noise / grain\n            volume +     and camera    floor and\n            depth of     shake         dynamic range\n            field"
    },
