      },
      "text": "Crop factor = full-frame diagonal / sensor diagonal\n  APS-C: ~1.5× (Nikon, Sony) or 1.6× (Canon)\n  Micro Four Thirds: 2×\n  1-inch: 2.7×"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#021",
