      },
      "text": "Why smaller sensors are noisier (same pixel count):\n  Smaller sensor → smaller pixels → less light per pixel → worse SNR\n  Shot noise ∝ √(photon count) → fewer photons → higher relative noise\n  Why pixel count alone is misleading for low-light comparisons"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#022",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
