        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Photography - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Metric | Film equivalent | Digital equivalent | Limiting factor |\n|--------|-----------------|--------------------|-----------------|\n| **Resolution** | Film grain (lp/mm) | Megapixels | Lens MTF, diffraction, AA filter |\n| **Dynamic range** | Exposure latitude (stops) | Stops (12–16 for modern sensors) | Shot noise vs read noise floor |\n| **Sensitivity** | ISO/ASA rating | ISO (amplification) | Read noise, shot noise |\n| **Color accuracy** | Dye metamerism, film stock | Color filter array + WB algorithm | Bayer interpolation, illuminant |\n| **Sharpness** | Acutance (edge contrast) | Sharpening algorithms | MTF, pixel pitch, stabilization |\n| **Temporal resolution** | Not applicable | Frame rate, rolling shutter | Data throughput, readout speed |"
    },
